, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Evan finds nature to be peaceful, calming, and fun. (event_time: 2023-08-27T10:18:00Z)\n  - Sam shares the sentiment with Evan that being in nature is calming. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Nature acts like a reset button for Evan's mind and body. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Evan encourages Sam to enjoy time in nature. (event_time: 2023-08-27T10:18:00Z)\n  - Nature brings peace to Evan. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Nature had a relaxing effect on Evan. (event_time: 2023-07-27T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan considers nature a great experience. (event_time: 2023-12-31T11:00:00Z)\n  - Sam enjoys being surrounded by nature because it is tranquil and refreshing. (event_time: 2023-08-27T10:18:00Z)\n  - Sam thinks that being in nature is calming. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Evan aims to convey the peacefulness of being outdoors in his paintings. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Evan asked Sam if they enjoy exploring nature. (event_time: 2023-08-27T10:18:00Z)\n  - Evan advises finding joy in small moments outdoors. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Sam feels that connecting with nature is what they need. (event_time: 2023-10-17T13:50:00Z)\n  - Sam agrees that being outdoors has a rejuvenating effect. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Evan asked Sam if being in the countryside helps Sam get fresh air away from the city. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Sam agrees with the sentiment that being outdoors is rejuvenating. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Evan wishes Sam well and encourages Sam to have fun. (event_time: 2023-05-24T19:11:00Z)\n  - Evan prefers being active outdoors over the current easy exercises he is doing. (event_time: 2023-10-06T20:57:00Z)\n  - Sam suggests to Evan that a trip sounds like the perfect way to de-stress. (event_time: 2023-11-09T21:13:00Z)\n  - Sam has a mindset that Evan finds helpful. (event_time: 2023-08-13T16