ed a conference in Detroit where he learned a lot. Calvin acknowledged learning about the Detroit conference.\n  - journey: Calvin is on a musical journey, confirmed by Dave who congratulated him on a gala attendance and upcoming performance. Dave is keen to hear about it and see a show in Boston.\n  - event: Calvin attended a fancy gala in Boston yesterday, had an inspiring chat with an artist about music and art, and Dave inquired who he talked with most interestingly.\n  - Dave: Dave's band had a fun rehearsal session last night. Last weekend, Dave attended a rock concert in Boston. Dave is also praised by Calvin for fixing cars.\n  - Dave: Dave is restoring a Ford Mustang from a junkyard, working on car mods, and added a custom exhaust and performance upgrades to it. He attended a car show last Friday.\n  - Dave: Dave congratulated Calvin on his album release and expressed enthusiasm for live music. Dave invited Calvin to see his cool cars in his garage.\n  - Fireworks: The Fireworks headlined a festival and recently performed with Frank Ocean, with Calvin noting the electric crowd energy.\n  - Dave: Dave enjoys photography, taking pictures of local scenery. He talked with Calvin about Calvin's inspiring chat with an artist at an event.\n  - Dave: Dave previously enjoyed a card night and is restoring a car for his auto engineering goal. He chatted with Calvin about Calvin's amazing performance on a big stage.\n  - Dave: Dave congratulated Calvin on his new album party, asked about the cheering, and commented that music can affect mood and help stay on track.\n  - Fenway Park: Fenway Park is a location mentioned by Dave as a cool spot in Boston with an awesome music scene, alongside Paradise Rock and House of Blues.\n  - House of Blues: Dave told Calvin that House of Blues is a cool music spot in Boston that Calvin should check out when he visits.\n  - band: Dave is in a rock band, which he has been a fan of for ages, and he recently joined them. He shared the ba