e conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Andrew is jealous of the fun outings involving Audrey's dogs. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Andrew notes that not everyone feels the same way about the pooches as he and Audrey do. (event_time: 2023-06-26T13:51:00Z)\n  - Audrey expects Andrew to share a picture of his dog soon. (event_time: 2023-05-06T10:47:00Z)\n  - Andrew is asking about the current status of Audrey's dogs. (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Audrey finds it frustrating not to find pet-friendly spots. (event_time: 2023-07-03T20:32:00Z)\n  - Andrew enjoys the prospect of being in nature with Audrey's dogs. (event_time: 2023-06-13T17:23:00Z)\n  - Audrey has a dog. (event_time: 2023-10-13T16:22:00Z)\n  - Andrew hopes Audrey's dogs can join them soon. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Andrew believes that Audrey's dogs are lucky to have her as an owner. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey feels she is a good doggy mom because Andrew appreciates her pets being happy and settled in new places (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Andrew is seeking advice from Audrey on creating a strong relationship with dogs. (event_time: 2023-09-24T17:53:00Z)\n  - Andrew is asking Audrey if her dogs can still go on adventures. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Andrew stated that Audrey's dogs are having a blast. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Andrew asked Audrey what type her dogs are. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Andrew expressed sympathy to Audrey regarding the search for dog-friendly spots to rent. (event_time: 2023-07-03T20:32:00Z)\n  - Andrew hopes that Audrey's dogs get better. (event_